    {
      "type":"text","id":"stage2_note","x":1880,"y":1178,"width":520,"height":255,
      "text":"SGLang 的主 SWA pool 按 256-token page 存储；\nFlashInfer SM120 decode fast path 要求 64-token page。\n因此只对主 SWA cache 做 256 → 4×64 的布局转换。\n\nPR #32320 先由 _page_mark_kernel 标记本轮触达页，\n再让 _page_split_kernel 跳过未触达页；目标 buffer\n跨 step 复用，未读取的旧页无需重写。\n\n显式 backend=triton/torch 不走这条公共拆页路径。","originalText":"SGLang 的主 SWA pool 按 256-token page 存储；\nFlashInfer SM120 decode fast path 要求 64-token page。\n因此只对主 SWA cache 做 256 → 4×64 的布局转换。\n\nPR #32320 先由 _page_mark_kernel 标记本轮触达页，\n再让 _page_split_kernel 跳过未触达页；目标 buffer\n跨 step 复用，未读取的旧页无需重写。\n\n显式 backend=triton/torch 不走这条公共拆页路径。",
      "fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":530047,"version":1,"versionNonce":530048,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4
    },
