    {
      "type":"text","id":"stage3_note","x":1880,"y":1593,"width":520,"height":190,
      "text":"Router 为每个 token 产生 256 个专家分数，\n只保留 Top-6 的 expert IDs 与权重。\n\nRouted experts 处理内容差异，shared expert 始终参与；\n两路结果加权合并并与残差相加，Shape 恢复为\n[T,4096]，然后送入下一 Decoder Block。","originalText":"Router 为每个 token 产生 256 个专家分数，\n只保留 Top-6 的 expert IDs 与权重。\n\nRouted experts 处理内容差异，shared expert 始终参与；\n两路结果加权合并并与残差相加，Shape 恢复为\n[T,4096]，然后送入下一 Decoder Block。",
      "fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":540043,"version":1,"versionNonce":540044,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4
